  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1253059.svg\" alt=\"заголовок\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&link=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"Статический значок\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Статический значок\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-yellow?style=plastic&link=https://fabricmc.net/\" alt=\"Статический значок\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Этот мод позволяет использовать любые монеты из <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/numismatic-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Numismatic Overhaul</a>&nbsp;в <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Numismatic Bounties/screen/base.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1037\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Также этот проект полностью совместим с <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-bounties\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Bounties</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Numismatic Bounties/screen/extra.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1034\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
